// ADR 28.9.26c § 2.4: the positive twin of
// tests/golden/error/positivity_impredicative_field.tg. `Pos` occurs only to
// the right of the arrow under the `forall`, so it is strictly positive and
// must check clean: the gate does not reject every `forall`-field.
type Pos = Leaf | Node(forall x. x -> Pos)
